  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5830,
      "text": "When the sky breaks apart.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5831,
      "text": "and when the stars fall, scattered,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5832,
      "text": "and when the seas burst forth,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5833,
      "text": "and when the graves are overturned,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5834,
      "text": "then each soul will come to know what it has done or what it has left undone.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5835,
      "text": "O mankind, what has lured you away from your Lord, the Most Generous,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5836,
      "text": "Who created you, then shaped and proportioned you,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5837,
      "text": "and assembled you in whatever form He willed?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5838,
      "text": "No indeed; but you deny the Judgment Day,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5839,
      "text": "while there are watchers[1] over you,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5840,
      "text": "honorable scribes,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5841,
      "text": "who know whatever you do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5842,
      "text": "Indeed, the righteous will be in Bliss,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5843,
      "text": "and the wicked will be in Blazing Fire,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5844,
      "text": "which they will enter on Judgment Day,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5845,
      "text": "and will never come out of it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5846,
      "text": "How do you know what Judgment Day is?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5847,
      "text": "Again, how do you know what Judgment Day is?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5848,
      "text": "It is the Day when no soul will be of any help to another, and all command on that Day will be with Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 82,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Infitaar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cleaving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 524,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5849,
      "text": "Woe to the defrauders[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5850,
      "text": "those who take full measure when they take from others,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5851,
      "text": "but they give less when they measure or weigh for them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5852,
      "text": "Do they really not think that they will be resurrected",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 587,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5853,
      "text": "for a momentous Day,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
